{"id":"n90312-1-7","stage":5,"title":"야단치다 · 训斥","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90312-1-7-1","ko":"아이에게 너무 야단치지 마세요.","zh":"请不要对孩子太严厉地责骂。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이에게","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"야단치지","meaning":"训斥，叱责","explanation":"야단치다：训斥，叱责；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"야단치다","audio":"/audio/58edb2a0881c7a05d5ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90312","senseId":"1","lemma":"야단치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마세요.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"1","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"58edb2a0881c7a05","term":"야단치다","zh":"训斥，叱责","audio":"/audio/58edb2a0881c7a05d5ed.mp3","entryId":"90312","definition":"高声严厉地责备。","pronunciation":["야ː단치다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c1559f4620dc2c7919a1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90312-1-7-2","ko":"잘못을 했으면 따끔하게 혼나야죠.","zh":"犯了错的话，当然要好好训斥一下。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"잘못을","meaning":"错，错误","explanation":"잘못：错，错误；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"잘못","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62477","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했으면","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"따끔하게","meaning":"严厉，锐利，狠狠的","explanation":"따끔하다：严厉，锐利，狠狠的；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"따끔하다","audio":"/audio/df811b1594926fda3b39.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49647","senseId":"3","lemma":"따끔하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"혼나야죠.","meaning":"被大骂，被怒斥","explanation":"혼나다：被大骂，被怒斥；어야죠：어야지요的缩合，表示“应该、必须”或确认应当如此。","readings":[{"term":"혼나다","audio":"/audio/b4d47e56735ffcb5a8a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87966","senseId":"2","lemma":"혼나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"cd1c34de004dbb0d","term":"잘못","zh":"错，错误","audio":"/audio/cd1c34de004dbb0df843.mp3","entryId":"62477","definition":"做不好或做错的事。","pronunciation":["잘몯"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"df811b1594926fda","term":"따끔하다","zh":"严厉，锐利，狠狠的","audio":"/audio/df811b1594926fda3b39.mp3","entryId":"49647","definition":"心里受到刺激，总感觉被针刺似的。","pronunciation":["따끔하다"]},{"id":"b4d47e56735ffcb5","term":"혼나다","zh":"被大骂，被怒斥","audio":"/audio/b4d47e56735ffcb5a8a4.mp3","entryId":"87966","definition":"被严重指责或受罚。","pronunciation":["혼나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1e72a67ee85287aec166.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.535,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=90312","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":171,"sequenceScore":3.3617,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["请不要对孩子太严厉地责骂。","犯了错的话，当然要好好训斥一下。","看，智秀在对面！"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["请不要对孩子太严厉地责骂。","犯了错的话，当然要好好训斥一下。","看，智秀在对面！"],"answer":1}]}
